What’s your hand soap saying about you?

“Status symbols are finding themselves in so many seemingly mundane products.”
Somewhere between @aesop becoming a fixture in well appointed bathrooms and @loewe convincing us that tomato scented soap is worth $90, washing your hands became another way to broadcast taste.

@officialbyredo, @diptyque, lelabofragrances, @flamingo_estate,and other IYKYK bottles have turned the bathroom sink into real estate of status symbols, offering a literal pump of luxury that isn’t the price of a handbag.

